  "post_content": "<p>La plantila del CD Onda B y la directiva de la Escuela de F&uacute;tbol, de la que depende este equipo, celebraron anoche con una cena en los Salones Campus el ascenso a 1&ordf; regional y el campeonato de liga del grupo III de 2&ordf;.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcdondab/img_7189.jpg\" alt=\"img_7189\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcdondab/img_7191.jpg\" alt=\"img_7191\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcdondab/img_7192.jpg\" alt=\"img_7192\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcdondab/img_7193.jpg\" alt=\"img_7193\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcdondab/img_7194.jpg\" alt=\"img_7194\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcdondab/img_7195.jpg\" alt=\"img_7195\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcdondab/img_7196.jpg\" alt=\"img_7196\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcdondab/img_7197.jpg\" alt=\"img_7197\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcdondab/img_7198.jpg\" alt=\"img_7198\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcdondab/img_7199.jpg\" alt=\"img_7199\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcdondab/img_7200.jpg\" alt=\"img_7200\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-91